---
// No props — this is a one-off branded card
---

<a href="https://pop-ai.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="popai-card">
  <div class="popai-card__eyebrow">AI for the Rest of Us</div>
  <svg class="popai-card__mark" viewBox="0 0 256 256" width="48" height="48" aria-label="Pop Artificial Intelligence wordmark">
    <rect width="256" height="256" rx="8" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#1A1A1A" stroke-width="3"/>
    <text x="128" y="120" font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" font-weight="900" font-size="100" fill="#1A1A1A" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="-4">POP</text>
    <line x1="48" y1="138" x2="208" y2="138" stroke="#1A1A1A" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.3"/>
    <text x="128" y="162" font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" font-weight="600" font-size="14.5" fill="#1A1A1A" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="5" opacity="0.6">ARTIFICIAL</text>
    <text x="128" y="182" font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" font-weight="600" font-size="14.5" fill="#1A1A1A" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="5" opacity="0.6">INTELLIGENCE</text>
  </svg>
  <h3 class="popai-card__title">Pop Artificial Intelligence</h3>
  <p class="popai-card__desc">
    Understanding AI — mechanism, not marketing. A weekly newsletter making
    complex technology navigable for intelligent non-specialists.
  </p>
  <div class="popai-card__tags">
    <span class="popai-card__tag">Substack</span>
    <span class="popai-card__tag">AI Explainers</span>
    <span class="popai-card__tag">Weekly</span>
  </div>
  <span class="popai-card__arrow">&rarr;</span>
</a>

<style>
  .popai-card {
    display: block;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.08);
    border-top: 2px solid transparent;
    border-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #E63946, transparent) 1;
    border-image-slice: 1 0 0 0;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    position: relative;
  }

  .popai-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.15);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .popai-card__eyebrow {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #1A1A1A;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .popai-card__mark {
    display: block;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .popai-card__title {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #1A1A1A;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .popai-card__desc {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'SF Pro Display', 'Inter', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #555555;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .popai-card__tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .popai-card__tag {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #1A1A1A;
    border: 1px solid rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.15);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .popai-card__arrow {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #E63946;
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 2rem;
    right: 2rem;
  }
</style>
